        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "1 年前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "該露營地由香港青年聯會於2024年全新開放，擁有現代化的設施和舒適的住宿環境。營地朝西，坐擁無與倫比的海景，可欣賞壯麗的日落美景。這裡是學校、企業和家庭的理想選擇。營地提供各種水上活動和燒烤設施，並設有咖啡廳。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "The campsite, newly opened by the Hong Kong Federation of Youth Groups in 2024, features very modern facilities and comfortable accommodations. With unbeatable ocean views facing west, you can enjoy stunning sunsets. It’s a great site ideal for schools, businesses, and families. There are various water activities and BBQ options available, as well as an on-site cafe.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
